// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4194083598" "Summon Terror: Ranged Fear"
// Power Help Text :
"P3700068927" "You can create an illusion of unspeakable Terror. The manifestation is so horrible that it caused most foes to tremble helplessly in terror. The Spectral Terror may also Terrify individual foes, causing them to run away in panic. Recharge: Slow"
