"P2101973492" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P3206109647" "You swing your Ninja Blade in a wide arc in front of you, slicing multiple foes with lethal damage. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making him easier to hit. If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical for extra damage.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

