"P1110037938" "Divine Avalanche"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P869241214" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal), Self +DEF (Melee, Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4178460927" "You can use your Ninja Blade to parry incoming melee attacks and then quickly return the favor. Divine Avalanche does minor damage, but every successful hit will increase your Defense against melee and lethal attacks for a short while. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Exploding Shuriken 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Danger Sense 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3260963519" "Danger Sense"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1274664800" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Melee, Ranged, AoE), Res(DeBuff DEF), +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Psionics), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P358491948" "Activating your Danger Sense enables you to be more evasive to melee, range and area effect attacks. This will increase your Defense versus melee as long as it is active. Danger Sense also grants you resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilization, Confusion, Fear, and Defense DeBuffs as well as resistance to Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disembowel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2342337324" "Soaring Dragon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2714891084" "Melee, Superior DMG(Lethal), Foe Knockup, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3801632433" "You perform a powerful Soaring Dragon maneuver that deals a great amount of lethal damage, and can knock a target up into the air. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making him easier to hit. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Sha 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1895928915" "Kuji-In Sha"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3810685749" "Self Heal, Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3469865187" "Kuji-In Sha invokes the power of Sha, or healing. Focusing your inner power, you can heal your body of its wounds and leave yourself resistant to the effects of Toxic damage for a while. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Retsu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3602318660" "Kuji-In Retsu"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3479477082" "Self +DEF, + SPD, +Recovery, Res(DeBuff DEF), +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P544106076" "Kuji-In Retsu is the mastery of space and time. Focusing your power on Retsu enables you to control your own time to easily defeat your foes. Mastery of this power enables you to avoid almost any attack, be it ranged, melee, or area effect. Your running speed, jumping height and Endurance Recovery are also increased. Retsu also grants you high resistance to Defense DeBuffs. When Retsu wears off, you are left drained of all Endurance and unable to Recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Head Splitter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2240630470" "Golden Dragonfly"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2993209467" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Lethal), Foe Knockback, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1117471105" "You perform a devastating Golden Dragonfly attack that deals a massive amount of lethal damage and can even knock a foe down to the ground and reduce his Defense. The power of this attack can actually extend a short distance through multiple foes. If executed while hidden, only some affected targets may be hit with a Critical, however, there is a chance you may land a Critical hit with Golden Dragonfly even if you are not Hidden.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"

