"P3412974253" "Shadow Maul"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1424055329" "Melee (Cone), High DoT(Smash/Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P3955659983" "You wrap your entire arms with Negative Energy channeled from the Netherworlds, then perform a series of blows that deal a lot of damage over a short period of time to multiple targets in front of you. These blows cloud your target's vision, lowering his Accuracy for a short time. Damage: High(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P908681756" "Your Accuracy has been reduced by the Shadow Maul."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2844141455" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage."

