// Power : Gloom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3488406895" "Gloom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P989391228" "Ranged, High DoT(Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P839873235" "Gloom slowly drains a target of life, while reducing his Accuracy. Slower than Dark Blast, but deals more damage over time. Damage: High(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1507726705" "DoT(Negative), -ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3561705469" "The Gloom is causing damage to you and reducing your Accuracy."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3406939394" "{PlayerSource} drains you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage."

