// Display Name :
"P3063295318" "Dark Embrace"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2675416216" "Toggle: Self +Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P1020615839" "You tap into the energy of the Netherworld to protect yourself from damage."

