// Display Name :
"P1123970646" "Siphon Life"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P655369961" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -ACC, Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P1284280196" "You tap the power of the Netherworld and create a life transferring conduit between a foe and yourself. This will transfer Hit Points from your enemy to yourself. Foes Siphoned in this manner have their Accuracy reduced. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P134135355" "Your Accuracy has been reduced by the Siphon Life attack."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2427667038" "{PlayerSource} drains you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your accuracy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Consumption 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3604985100" "Dark Consumption"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3664607997" "PBAoE Moderate DMG(Negative), Self +End"
// Power Help Text :
"P670170653" "The dark power of the Netherworld allows you to tap the essence of your foe's soul and transfer it to yourself. This will drain the Hit Points of your enemy and add to your Endurance. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Touch of Fear 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1744130983" "Touch of Fear"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P438692790" "Melee Fear, Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P4152354647" "The Netherworld is one scary place, and with but a touch, you can give your enemy a glimpse into this dark world. This will cause them to helplessly tremble in Fear. Foes in this state of panic have reduced Accuracy. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2806172908" "Fear, -ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4143740792" "You are terrified and your Accuracy is reduced."

