"P3103415061" "Midnight Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2222252090" "Melee, Superior DMG(Negative), Foe Immobilize, -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P1403688338" "Mastery over the forces of the Netherworld allows you to create dark tentacles that can Immobilize a foe and continuously drain his life force. Damage: Superior(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P636577031" "Immobilize, -ACC"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1004602454" "The dark tentacles of the Midnight Grasp are holding you immobile.  Your Accuracy is reduced."
