"P571716827" "Charged Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P999772064" "Toggle: Self +Res(Smash, Lethal, Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2581913476" "When you toggle on this power, you are surrounded in a charged field that makes you highly resistant to Smashing, Lethal, Fire, Cold, Energy and Negative Energy damage."

