"P207511356" "Cauterize"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3874865543" "Heals a single targeted ally by cauterizing their wounds. You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Melt Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3190899346" "Melt Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P883673132" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Res, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1400823450" "The searing Heat from this power is enough to Melt the Armor and defenses of all targets in the affected area. Melt Armor significantly weakens the Defense and Damage Resistance of the affected targets. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1591168787" "Your {PowerName} reduced the Defense and Damage Resistance of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2601170309" "{PlayerSource} melts your armor lowering your defenses and damage potential."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1874250117" "-DMG, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P397266516" "Your Defense and Damage Resistances have been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Inferno 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P361595644" "Inferno"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3360089935" "PBAoE, Extreme DMG(Fire/Smash), Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P3094366122" "Unleashes a massive fiery explosion to devastate all nearby enemies and set them ablaze. Inferno deals massive damage to all nearby foes, although the damage does vary.  Activating this power leaves you drained of Endurance and unable to recover Endurance for a while. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"

