"P2392861019" "Freeze Ray"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4164215796" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Cold), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P639284835" "Although this power deals very little damage, the Freeze Ray encases your foe in a block of ice, holding him helpless in place for a while. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3798667255" "You are frozen solid by the Freeze Ray."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4128932286" "{PlayerSource} freezes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of cold damage."

