// Power Set : Assault_Rifle_Corruptor_Mid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2135552475" "Assault Rifle Corruptor Mid"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seeker Drones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3542936972" "Seeker Drones"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4021184008" "Summon Seekers: Ranged Disorient, -DMG, -ACC, -Perception, Low DMG(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P384840865" "You create two Seeker Drones. These Seeker Drones will follow you until they detect an enemy and then they will zero in on their targets and detonate on impact. The small explosive flash of energy does only minor damage, but the concussion can weaken foes.  Affected targets will have reduced Damage, Accuracy and Perception and may even be Disoriented for a short while.  You can only ever have Two Seeker Drones out at one time and they can be destroyed by your foes. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ignite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1492322528" "Ignite"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1620482472" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P34011997" "Sprays a targeted location with accelerant from your flamethrower, igniting the location. Any foes that pass through the flames will be burned. Great for blocking doorways and small passages. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P446448169" "You have been ignited!  You are burning."

