// Power Help Text :
"P888087193" "Opens up your assault rifle on Full Auto to lay down a massive spray of bullets at your target. Although very slow to reload, damage from this attack is massive, shredding all targets within the narrow cone of effect. There's a chance you may land a lucky shot for extra damage. Damage: Superior(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1460277070" "{PowerSource} lands a lucky shot and hit you for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

