"P3475731785" "Cinders"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P646414368" "PBAoE, Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2351863452" "Incapacitates foes around the caster by whirling Cinders around them. The targets are left helpless, choking on the soot. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3466769997" "You are choking on Cinders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Incinerate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2267797463" "Intense concentration can allow you to Incinerate an opponent at melee range. This will set your foe ablaze, dealing damage over time. Damage: High(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3168769471" "You are burning!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Breath 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1663310391" "Close (Cone), Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3542949567" "You can breathe forth a torrent of fire that burns all foes within its narrow cone. Very accurate and very deadly at medium range. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P282569673" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3599208445" "Sends a Blast of Fire at a targeted foe and sets the target on fire for a short period of time. Slower recharge rate than Flares, but more damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combustion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3088194875" "PBAoE, Moderate DoT(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3876623488" "Your mastery of fire allows you to violently raise the temperature around yourself in an attempt to spontaneously combust any nearby foes and set them ablaze, dealing damage over time. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3006196227" "{PlayerSource} continues to burn you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Fire_Dominator_High 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2755225971" "Fire Dominator High"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fire Imps 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P638235624" "Fire Imps"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1781968311" "Summon Imps: Melee Minor DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3828986822" "You can craft 3 small Fire Imps out of pure flame in a targeted location. Fire Imps will viciously attack any nearby foes, but they only possess the most basic instincts. Fire Imps can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Plant_Dominator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P165874344" "Plant Dominator"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Strangler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1512853674" "Strangler"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3361538192" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smashing), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2121824688" "Holds a distant foe by Strangling him with massive root-like vines. The target is held helpless, while he is slowly crushed by the vines. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1388205829" "Hold, DoT(Smashing)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1317566367" "The Strangler Vine is crushing you and preventing you from acting."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2383523282" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with Strangler Vines for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Roots 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P643865738" "Roots"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1693257692" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Smashing, Lethal), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3338619209" "Immobilizes a group of foes by entangling their feet in a twisted mass of thorny Roots.  Roots is slower and does less damage than Entangle, but it can capture multiple foes in one attack. Like Entangle, Roots can immobilize flying targets, if they are near the ground when attacked. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P96007827" "Immobilize, DoT(Smashing, Lethal), -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3912708265" "The Roots have entangled you. You are immobile and cannot fly."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3511610119" "{PlayerSource} Roots you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1781923097" "The roots cut you for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seeds of Confusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P822704386" "Seeds of Confusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P233247000" "Ranged (Cone), Foe Confuse"
// Power Help Text :
"P2412309615" "You throw a handful of seeds from a rare Baffle plant at your foes.  The seeds spread out in a wide cone and release a dusty chaff that contain a number of alkaloids and hallucinogenic compounds.  Foes that come into contact with these seeds become violently confused and will turn and attack each other, ignoring you and all your allies. You will not receive any Experience Points for foes defeated entirely by Confused enemies. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1116895679" "Confuse"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4213198885" "You are confused and may attack an incorrect target."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Vines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2760912049" "Vines"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3095732666" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P267223508" "Creates a field of Strangler Vines that can Hold multiple foes at range. The affected targets are held helpless by the massive root-like vines. Unlike the power Strangler, this power does not deal any damage, but it can Hold multiple foes at once. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1778180013" "The Vines are Holding you and preventing you from acting."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Skewer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P788360112" "Skewer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1058759904" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P4012426895" "You lunge forward with this melee attack and Skewer your foe with the large Thorn on your arm. Deals moderate damage and poisons your foe. Poison from the Thorns deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes Defense. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2583813465" "DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1445036679" "You are poisoned!  You are taking Toxic Damage and your Defense is Reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1531587301" "You take {Damage} points of poison damage from the Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fling Thorns 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1788509851" "Fling Thorns"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1887834338" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2265353391" "You can throw dozens of Thorns in a wide cone in front of you, impaling foes caught within the area. These Thorns deals moderate damage, and poisons any targets it hits. Thorn poison deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes' Defense.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P258301312" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thorn Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2861025649" "Thorn Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1353933233" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3514965151" "You can explode dozens of Thorns in all directions around you. These Thorns only travel a short distance, but they can deal moderate damage and poison any target close to you. Toxic damage from the thorns can reduce the Defense of affected foes. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1988363654" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ripper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3665143764" "Melee (Cone), High DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF, Knockback, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P4247995532" "You can unleash a spectacular slashing maneuver that attacks all foes in a wide arc directly in front of you. Ripper deals massive damage and poisons multiple targets. It can even knock foes down. Thorn poison deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes Defense. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P916013742" "{PlayerSource} Slashes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Plant_Dominator_High 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P572304877" "Plant Dominator High"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fly Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P349392526" "Fly Trap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3041632272" "Summon Fly Trap: Ranged Control Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P785516111" "You can summon a giant carnivorous Fly Trap plant beast.  Fly Trap may be an understatement, as this plant beast has a taste for flesh.  The Fly Trap will viciously attack any nearby foes; biting, hurling poisonous Thorns and even casting its own Entangle Roots. The Fly Trap will fight by your side and can be healed and buffed like any teammate. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Thorn Barrage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3090654239" "Thorn Barrage"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3320616766" "Close, High DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P827788320" "A short range, but devastating attack. Thorn Barrage unleashes your Thorns at high velocity causing severe damage at close range.  Although these Thorns only travel a short distance, their impact can knock most foes on their back. Thorn poison deals additional Toxic damage and can reduce your foes Defense. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P212445195" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mastermind_Leadership 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2775662587" "Mastermind Leadership"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Maneuvers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3009043276" "Maneuvers"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1371705735" "PBAoE, Team +DEF(All), +DMG, Res(Taunt, Placate), +ACC, Res(Confuse, Fear), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P569848964" "Good leaders are rare. These powers can grant bonuses to your and your teammates."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2745021831" "+DEF(All), +DMG, Res(Taunt, Placate), +ACC, Res(Confuse), +Perception"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Robotics_Mastermind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3348010742" "Robotics Mastermind"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Pulse Rifle Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2390537843" "Pulse Rifle Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3974667326" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Energy/Smash)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2068315462" "This Pulse Rifle can fire a long range laser pulse. Deals moderate Smashing/Energy damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1765093585" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Pulse Rifle Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3171791695" "Pulse Rifle Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1310935663" "Ranged, High (Energy/Smash), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3992065073" "This high powered laser pulse from your Pulse Rifle takes more energy to fire, but causes much more damage than a standard pulse and has a very good chance to send your foes flying. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2034897495" "{PlayerSource} drains you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Photon Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3279358895" "Photon Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3852829958" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Energy/Smash), Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P4021210013" "Launches an Energy Grenade at long range from your Pulse Rifle. The energy from this explosion can Disorient some targets in the affected area. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3255914252" "The Photon Grenade has Disoriented you."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3097641125" "{PlayerSource} hits you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Battle Drones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3669747371" "Battle Drones"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1181773189" "Summon Battle Drones"
// Power Help Text :
"P427902061" "Construct one to three Battle Drones (depending on your level) to do your bidding. Drones start out with only basic weaponry, but can be upgraded with heavier energy weapons. Drones can Super Leap. You may only have 3 Drones under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to construct more Drones, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle.  If you already have three, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Protector Bots 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1208187839" "Protector Bots"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P585895900" "Summon Protector Bot"
// Power Help Text :
"P1762938773" "You can summon one to two powerful Protector Bots (depending on your level).  Protector Bots can defend your army by placing Force Fields on you and your allies. They can even be equipped to repair your other Robot Henchmen.  Make no mistake though, the best defense is a good offense, and Protector Bots are well equipped with energy weapons. You may only have 2 Protector Bots under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon more Protector Bots, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle.  If you already have two, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assault Bot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P524637202" "Assault Bot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1161639854" "Summon Assault Bot"
// Power Help Text :
"P2129612331" "Builds one massive Assault Bot.  Simply put, the Assault Bot is a killing machine.  There is nothing subtle about its weaponry. You may only have 1 Assault Bot under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon another Assault Bot, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Personal Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3978803010" "Personal Force Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3850683110" "Toggle: Self +Def, Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2723592640" "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of any attacks that do get through. The Personal Force Field works both ways; while it is active, you can only use powers that affect yourself. Cannot be used with Rest. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dispersion Bubble 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2876428248" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team +Res(Hold, Immobilize, Disorient) +DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1398218065" "Creates a large bubble which protects all allies inside. While active, the Dispersion Bubble gives all allies within increased Defense against all attack types. The Dispersion Bubble also protects allies from Immobilization, Disorient, and Hold effects. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3780623979" "+Res(Hold, Immobilize, Disorient) +DEF(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1240327833" "The Dispersion Bubble is increasing your Defenses to all attacks and providing protection from Hold, Immobilize and Disorienting attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Repulsion Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P844134779" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Knockback, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3301989297" "Projects an expanding Force Bubble around an ally that knocks down and Disorients nearby foes. This power cannot be used on yourself. Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1956747474" "Your {PowerName} pounds {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Necromancy_Mastermind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P755974384" "Necromancy Mastermind"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P369601562" "Dark Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P561405518" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -ACC"
// Power Help Text :
"P3832565559" "A long range blast of dark energy. Deals moderate Negative Energy damage and reduces the target's Accuracy. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3785880809" "The Dark Blast has reduced your Accuracy."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4278049653" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduce your accuracy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gloom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Life Drain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2509558927" "{PlayerSource} drains you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your accuracy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Zombie Horde 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1229299309" "Zombie Horde"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1434861979" "Summon Zombies"
// Power Help Text :
"P436430207" "Summons one to three Zombies (depending on your level) to do your bidding. Zombies are very tough but can be slow and stupid.  They start out with only rudimentary melee attacks, but can be empowered with range and even life draining powers. You may only have 3 Zombies under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon more Zombies, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle.  If you already have three, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Grave Knight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3240964949" "Grave Knight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P60863633" "Summon Grave Knight"
// Power Help Text :
"P6845850" "You can summon one to two powerful Grave Knights (depending on your level) to do your bidding.  Grave Knights come well equipped with several attack powers and can be empowered with even more. You may only have 2 Grave Knights under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon more Grave Knights, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle.  If you already have two, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lich 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3124304184" "Lich"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1774529674" "Summon Lich"
// Power Help Text :
"P2108190491" "Summons a dark and powerful Lich.  The lich is an undead entity that, when alive, possessed many dark powers of his own.  Perhaps it was a dark wizard, or powerful arch villain.  Perhaps it was even a Necromancer.  Now it only hungers for the souls of the living, and is quite good at feeding itself. The Lich specializes in dark control and draining powers. You may only have 1 Lich under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon another Lich, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alkaloid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3338218470" "Alkaloid"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P192217088" "Ally Heal, +Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P633752156" "When used correctly, poisons can be used to heal, as well as harm.  Alkaloid consists of just the right amount of amino acids to safely heal a single targeted ally. The healed target is also left with some resistance to Toxic Damage (This Toxic Damage Resistance cannot be Enhanced). You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P711986937" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and improves you resistance to Toxic Damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Neurotoxic Breath 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1837006782" "Neurotoxic Breath"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3242282090" "Ranged (Cone), Foe -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P413475405" "You can breath a cone of Neurotoxin gas that quickly start to anesthetize any nearby foes.  Affected targets may choke on the gas as their movement and attack rate are severely reduced. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P706922686" "Your {PowerName} dramatically Slows the attack speed and movement of {PlayerDest}"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P115947258" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with his {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3697806060" "You are choking on Neurotoxic gas.  Your attack rate and movement speed are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Paralytic Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2127894003" "Paralytic Poison"
// Power Help Text :
"P4045211070" "This Paralytic Poison viciously attacks a foe's nervous system and can leave an affected target completely Held and defenseless. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3786662314" "{PlayerSource} attempts to Hold you with a Paralytic Poison."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3285550051" "The Paralytic Poison has left you completely Held and defenseless!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ninja_Mastermind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1861138954" "Ninja Mastermind"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Snap Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2783200921" "Snap Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1884795216" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P582361347" "A quick attack that fires an arrow at your foe after only minimal aiming. Fast, but little damage. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Aimed Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2290581486" "Aimed Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1091487416" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1173413105" "Though it takes longer to execute, your Aimed Shot deals greater damage than Snap Shot. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2492772538" "{PlayerSource} hits your with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fistful of Arrows 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P34818005" "Fistful of Arrows"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1881225209" "You fire a fistful of arrows at foes in a cone in front of you. Good at close range. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Call Genin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2880843410" "Call Genin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1506353275" "Summon Genin"
// Power Help Text :
"P4009646636" "Calls forth one to three Genin Ninja (depending on your level) to do your bidding. Genin have good reflexes and jumping skill, but they are still the lowest rank Ninja and only possess the most rudimentary skills,  However, they can be trained in more advanced techniques and weapons. You may only have 3 Genin under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to call Genin, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle.  If you already have three, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Call Jounin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1570421815" "Call Jounin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2227083749" "Summon Jounin"
// Power Help Text :
"P348605453" "You can summon one to two highly skilled Jounin Ninja (depending on your level).  Jounin Ninja are master assassins and expert swordsmen. They possess superior reflexes and jumping skill. Like all Henchmen, Jounin can be trained in even deadlier Ninjitsu techniques and weapons. You may only have 2 Jounin under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon more Jounin, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle.  If you already have two, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Oni 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1268223034" "Oni"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1633076573" "Summon Oni"
// Power Help Text :
"P1141681696" "Summons an ancient and powerful Oni.  An Oni is a powerful human-like demon warrior.  The Oni is a formidable creature who possesses the skill of a warrior and the powers of wind and fire. You may only have 1 Oni under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon another Oni, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3416938233" "Ice Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3570542779" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3906379218" "This arrow can freeze a single foe in a block of ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be Held, but all affected targets will be Slowed. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2267104667" "Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1196691141" "You are frozen in a Block of Ice.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced slightly for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Acid Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2671335934" "Acid Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1594890146" "Ranged (AoE) Minor DoT(Toxic), Foe -Res(All), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1804268649" "This arrow explodes in a small shower of acid on impact. This acid eats through armor, causing damage over time. It reduces the target's Defense as well as his Damage Resistance.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3256323102" "Your {PowerName} splashes acid on {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P472308012" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an Acid Arrow.  The acid is burning you and reducing your damage resistance."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2396833550" "-Res(All), -DEF, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1207406105" "Your Resistances and Defense have been weakened by the Acid Arrow."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P254720165" "You take {Damage} points of Toxic Damage from the Acid Mortar."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P993615740" "EMP Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P175414405" "PBAoE, Foe Hold, Special vs. Robots, Self -Recovery"
